    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines a single cross-shard foreign-key constraint. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A constraint links a <emphasis>child</emphasis> column (the FK) to a <emphasis>parent</emphasis> column (the referenced key, usually the primary key) and carries the enforcement policy. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
